    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Monsterium - a 2D platformer where you play as a witch who has accidentally summoned a terrifying creature. Now, you must destroy the monster and send it back to where it came from. However, this is not as easy as it seems, as the creature is smarter and craftier than its summoner.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Monsterium, you control a witch who can jump between platforms and cast magic. Your goal is to raise all the platforms and then destroy the monster hanging from the ropes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    WASD - Movement<br />\r\n    WS - Raise and lower platforms<br />\r\n    Space - Jump<br />\r\n    F - Cast magic<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Unique visual style<br />\r\n    Atmospheric music<br />\r\n    Challenging gameplay",
